    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="0587" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg525"/>

                <head>No. 328.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 28,
                        1877</date>. (Received October 15.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 606.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The opening of Congress, which should have
                    occurred on the 16th instant, did not take place until the 19th instant on
                    account of the want of a quorum in the senate. The usual ceremonies occurred at
                    the latter date, with an address from the President of the republic, of which I
                    inclose herewith a copy and translation.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d333-a1.xml" xpointer="d333-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
